      "text": "The perfect introduction to Brazil, on a journey that combines dynamic cities, rich cultural heritage and idyllic beaches: from the cosmopolitan energy of São Paulo and the iconic landscapes of Rio de Janeiro to the colonial charm of Salvador da Bahia and the tranquil shores of Praia do Forte, with the ideal balance of sightseeing, culture and relaxation.",
